# TacticalPulse Index — Streamlit Cloud Secrets
# Copy this to .streamlit/secrets.toml (gitignored) or use Streamlit Cloud secrets panel.
# The app reads GROQ_API_KEY from either .env, st.secrets, or environment variables.
